7	/**
8	 * Normalizes the create-owner telephone by removing every non-digit character, then
9	 * requires exactly 10 digits. Runs after {@link RequireOwnerFields} (so the field is
10	 * present) and before {@link BuildOwner}, mutating the published body in place so the
11	 * mapped {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner} — and the response —
12	 * carries the stripped 10-digit value. A telephone that is not exactly 10 digits after
13	 * stripping is rejected 400 via {@link InvalidTelephoneException}.
14	 */
